<title>USA: Genentech chmn R. Swanson to retire.</title>
<headline>Genentech chmn R. Swanson to retire.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genentech Inc said Thursday it will name a new chairman at the end of this week to replace Robert Swanson, who said he will retire at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>Swanson, who was named chairman in 1990, will leave Genentech to devote more time to identifying and funding new biotechnology companies, the company said.</p>
</text>
